<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Capel upgrades Barclays.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Capel upgrades Barclays.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>HSBC James Capel upgraded Barclays Plc stock to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;hold&quot; on Friday, dealers said.  </p>
<p>Capel also raised its 1997 pre-tax pre-exceptional profit estimate to 2.425 billion stg from 2.286 billion stg, citing improved margins and a better first half for BZW, Barclay's brokerage arm, they said.</p>
<p>At 0820 GMT, Barclays shares were down one penny to 1237-1/2.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
